    {
      "source": "Listener that closes the application context if its parent is closed. It listens for\nrefresh events and grabs the current context from there, and then listens for closed\nevents and propagates it down the hierarchy.",
      "translation": "如果其父级关闭，则关闭应用程序上下文的监听器。它监听刷新事件并从中获取当前上下文，然后监听关闭事件并将其向下传播到层次结构中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses may override to create their own subclass of ContextCloserListener. This\nstill enforces the use of a weak reference.",
      "translation": "子类可以重写该方法以创建自己的 `ContextCloserListener` 子类。这仍然强制使用弱引用。",
      "count": 2
    },
